# el++ engine fixture 11 (src/test.slop: ksc-fixture-at, test-ksc-entailments).
# 11. The empty role: C ⊑ ∃owl:bottomObjectProperty.D makes C unsatisfiable, nothing else.
# Inside el++ whole: the engine must answer every class as the literal Psc
# reference does (test-ksc-engine-matches-reference).

@prefix : <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
:r a owl:ObjectProperty . :s a owl:ObjectProperty . :t a owl:ObjectProperty .
:C a owl:Class . :D a owl:Class .
:a a owl:NamedIndividual . :b a owl:NamedIndividual .
:C rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty owl:bottomObjectProperty ; owl:someValuesFrom :D ] .
